# badmagic.poke -- a handshake whose magic is wrong.
#
# "BSTX" rather than "BSTM". Whatever is on the far end of the pipe is not a
# brainstem program, so the broker refuses rather than trying to interpret
# the rest of the frame.
#   hello  op 01, len 10, magic "BSTX" rather than "BSTM"
EMIT 01 0a 00 42 53 54 58 01 00 00 00 00 00
READ 3
